Website that pulls every morning the most relevant news for me from a list of trusted sources, aggregates it and presents in a nice way.
The sources are hacker news, selected youtube channels, spotify podcasts, hugging face daily papers and substack newsletters.
I am most interested in general AI news but specifically in industrial AI.
The output should be a minimal modern looking website that is structured in 3x5 tiles, showing the 15 most important news of the day.
Every tile has a headline, the name of the publication and a short summary. A click on the tile opens the source link.
The website updates every morning at 6 am CET and all previous days are readily available in tabs at the top of the website (today, yesterday, 01 Jan 2026, 31 Dec 2025 .. and so on but only if already rendered)

